{"id":"n47fb7dade5","headline":"US Treasury raises third-quarter borrowing estimate to $739 billion","summary":"The Treasury expects to borrow $739 billion in the third quarter, $68 billion more than its May projection. Lower projected cash flows were only partly offset by a larger starting cash balance.","why":"Treasury borrowing needs determine how much government debt is issued to the market, which affects Treasury yields and liquidity. Larger issuance can pressure bond prices.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Washington","country":"United States of America","lat":38.9,"lon":-77.04,"region":"na"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/economy/policy/articles/us-treasury-raises-third-quarter-190213978.html"},"sources":[{"name":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/economy/policy/articles/us-treasury-raises-third-quarter-190213978.html"}],"published_at":"2026-08-03T19:02:13Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"87370dda9e586264","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-03T19:02:13Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-05T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IS","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/banknotes-money-3100563.jpg","alt":"banknotes money (illustration)","credit":"Ralphs_Fotos","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/handshake-agreement-trade-business-3100563/"}}